This license covers this project's own code and documentation only: the
parsing/extraction tooling in `tools/` and the format/opcode findings
written up in `OPCODES.md` / `RESOURCE_FORMAT.md`.

It does not cover Visual Basic 3.0 itself, its runtime (`VBRUN300.DLL`),
or any executable you use these tools against — none of which are included
in this repository. You'll need your own legally-obtained copy of VB3 to
use the `tools/vb3ide/` scripts, and your own copy of whatever `.exe` you
want to analyze.
